docs {
  # Delete ASH Exit Record
  
  Permanently deletes a single ASH exit record. The corresponding cache entry is also invalidated.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `delete` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description             |
  |-----------|--------|----------|-------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the exit record |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Confirmation that the record was deleted.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": null,
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                 |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID). |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                    |
}
